    <item>
      <title>Version 1.3.2</title>
      <sparkle:version>27</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Quick Look shows the whole image, and you can zoom in.</strong> Images used to open at full size and cut off at the top. They now open fitted, in a preview shaped to the image. Pinch, hold Command or Option and scroll, double-click, or press Command-Plus, Command-Minus, and Command-0 to zoom, then scroll or drag to move around.</li>
          <li><strong>Switch tabs with Command-1 through Command-9.</strong> Command-1 is History, and the rest open your pinboards in the order they appear.</li>
          <li><strong>A plain mouse wheel scrolls the card rows sideways.</strong> You no longer need to hold Shift over the cards, a pinboard, or the tab strip.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
      <pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 16:54:00 +0900</pubDate>
      <enclosure
        url="https://github.com/mobrava/Clipbara/releases/download/v1.3.2/Clipbara-v1.3.2.dmg"
        type="application/octet-stream"
        sparkle:edSignature="btou6UKHbw4KNTlWiZwXY/Qkk8WVx+de08a9hUYDMIGqSPaRe3MBIqqBViNGjXPdWFwCGzDK+XBq68bK0nj4CQ=="
        length="3144898"
      />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Version 1.3.1</title>
      <sparkle:version>25</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li><strong>The panel now opens on the display you are working on.</strong> On multi-display setups it could slide in on whichever screen last held focus, and with a display stacked below the primary one it could get stuck there for good.</li>
          <li><strong>The first shortcut press after launch opens the panel.</strong> It used to take up to three presses because the panel was still being built.</li>
          <li>The reveal animation now plays from the start instead of appearing part way through.</li>
          <li>Pinboard tabs no longer show a horizontal scrollbar.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
      <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 23:36:36 +0900</pubDate>
      <enclosure
        url="https://github.com/mobrava/Clipbara/releases/download/v1.3.1/Clipbara-v1.3.1.dmg"
