    <item>
      <title>Version 1.3.0</title>
      <sparkle:version>24</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Paste as plain text</strong> &mdash; hold Shift while clicking a rich-text or HTML clip to strip its formatting, or use the new Paste with Formatting / Paste as Plain Text context menu. Turn on &ldquo;Always Paste as Plain Text&rdquo; in Settings &gt; General to make it the default.</li>
          <li><strong>Backup and restore</strong> &mdash; export your clipboard history to a JSON file and import it back, so you can move it between Macs.</li>
          <li><strong>First-run onboarding tour</strong> that walks you through the panel shortcut, search, pinboards, and Quick Look.</li>
          <li>The Quick Look preview key is now configurable.</li>
          <li>Settings polish: hover balloons explain the shortcut rules and backup import, and the Settings window now comes to the front when opened from the menu bar.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
      <pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 18:30:00 +0900</pubDate>
      <enclosure
