    <item>
      <title>Version 1.2.0</title>
      <sparkle:version>22</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li><strong>PasteClip is now Clipbara!</strong> An unrelated app named PasteClip appeared on the Mac App Store, so the project has a new name. Same app, same features, same local-only privacy.</li>
          <li>The app bundle is now Clipbara.app &mdash; your clipboard history, pinboards, and settings carry over automatically</li>
          <li>New home: https://github.com/mobrava/Clipbara (old links redirect)</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
